  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -30,
        21
      ],
      "id": 16,
      "text": "ESP-IDF's continuous ADC driver with DMA samples\nGPIO0 (a 50 Hz sine of 0.25-2.25 V from V1 through R1)\nand GPIO1 (the potentiometer RV1) at 20 kHz, and the\nchip reads its temperature sensor. Every second\nAnalyzer > UART (UART0) shows each pin's sample count,\nminimum, maximum and mean in mV, and the temperature;\ndrag RV1, or change U1's Chip temperature, while running."
    }
